Polymer: Polyethylene (ring melt)
Property: radius_gyration = Varies with chain length; 
Additional Info: {"condition": "Ring melt"}
Force Field: united-atom (UA) model with parameters from Nath and Khare, Van der Ploeg and Berendsen, Toxvaerd, T
Source: Melt Structure and Dynamics of Unentangled Polyethylene Rings: Rouse Theory, Atomistic Molecular Dynamics Simulation, and Comparison with the Linear Analogues
DOI: https://doi.org/10.1021/ma1017555
